# The Daily run left to crash (its seed is the day's, so no planned moves): the countdown, a pause with Settings
# and How to Play opened from the pause panel and back, Resume, the crash's results and the Scores board; then a
# Practice run at Intense, paused, restarted and ended from the pause panel.
until 300 Metro Dash
frames 60
click Play Daily Run
until 60 Expected
frames 10
click =Start
until 120 GO
frames 5
key KeyP 1
until 60 Resume
frames 10
click =Settings
until 60 Open Options
frames 10
click =Back
until 60 End Run
frames 10
click =How to Play
until 60 Rules
frames 10
click =Back
until 60 End Run
frames 10
click =Resume
until 3000 Run Over
frames 20
expect Crushed it until the
save daily-crash
click =Menu
until 60 How to Play
frames 10
click =Scores
until 60 Local board
frames 10
expect Daily
save scores
click =Back
until 60 How to Play
frames 10
click =Practice
until 60 Unranked
frames 10
click =Intense
frames 5
click =Start Practice
until 60 Expected
frames 10
expect Practice — Intense
click =Start
until 120 GO
frames 20
key Escape 1
until 60 End Run
frames 10
click =Restart
until 120 GO
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 60 End Run
frames 10
click =End Run
until 60 Run Ended
frames 20
save practice-ended
